                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='42375' id='15' type-v2='text' w='19700' x='79500' y='6250'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='10'>Key findings</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='10'>1) Carrier and PDE services were the most frequently utilized healthcare services across all age groups.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='10'>2) Utilization patterns remained relatively stable by age.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='10'>3) Despite similar utilization patterns, inpatient spending increased substantially among older beneficiaries, peaking in the 85-94 age group.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
