                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='10'>3) Despite similar utilization patterns, inpatient spending increased substantially among older beneficiaries, peaking in the 85-94 age group.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
